</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Sargan</surname><given-names>DR</given-names></name><name><surname>Bhattacharya</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Confirmation of the rod cGMP phosphodiesterase beta subunit (PDE beta) nonsense mutation in affected rcd-1 Irish setters in the UK and development of a diagnostic test</article-title><source>Curr Eye Res</source><year>1993</year><volume>12</volume><fpage>861</fpage><lpage>866</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8261797</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ray</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Baldwin</surname><given-names>VJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Acland</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><name><surname>Blanton</surname><given-names>SH</given-names></name><name><surname>Aguirre</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cosegregation of codon 807 mutation of the canine rod cGMP phosphodiesterase beta gene and rcd1</article-title><source>Invest Ophthalmol Vis Sci</source><year>1994</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>4291</fpage><lpage>4299</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8002249</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Suber</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Pittler</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Qin</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Wright</surname><given-names>GC</given-names></name><name><surname>Holcombe</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name><name><surname>Craft</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lolley</surname><given-names>RN</given-names></name><name><surname>Baehr</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Hu